<title>USA: SEMCO names new CFO.</title>
<headline>SEMCO names new CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PORT HURON, Mich. 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SEMCO Energy Inc said Tuesday it named Robert Digan as chief financial officer, replacing Robert Caldwell, who resigned as of June 30.</p>
<p>Digan will assume his new position July 21.  He was most recently CFO of Supershuttle International, a Scottsdale, Ariz., transportation firm.</p>
<p>He also held the CFO position at Northern Pipeline Construction Co and Kemper Management Services Inc.</p>
